msgid "Status and evidence"
msgstr "状态与证据"

msgid ""
"Use these maintained records to locate implementation, software verification"
" and physical work. Their recorded source IDs and configurations remain "
"unchanged; this website build creates documentation evidence only."
msgstr "使用这些维护记录定位实现、软件验证和实板工作。记录中的源码身份和配置保持不变；本站构建只产生文档证据。"

msgid "Start with the {ref}`0.2.1 software preview <sdk-preview-v021>`, the {ref}`sealed candidate baseline <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>` and [iteration entry points](roadmap.md). These describe separate delivery scopes; a newer version does not inherit an older candidate's qualification."
msgstr "先查看{ref}`0.2.1 软件预览 <sdk-preview-v021>`、{ref}`封存候选基线 <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`和[迭代入口](roadmap.md)。这些记录描述各自的交付范围；新版本不继承旧候选的资格。"
